{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0543_1000_p", "source_sha256": "589f35cc246946716fc7a7194e78374dbd802452cc7f7613b63b1a914ab6e8c1", "ja": "（雪歩と真のツインライブは反響を呼び、\n今日は雪歩が音楽番組にゲスト出演した）", "zh": "（雪步和真的双人演唱会引起了热烈反响，\n今天雪步作为嘉宾参加了音乐节目）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0543_1001_004yuk", "source_sha256": "9fa704b2fcbad64aa1c036d01e48e3134b4c0a0b88e54b9949406dc6e610a04e", "ja": "ふんふんふ～ん……\nあ、{$P$}、お疲れさまですぅ♪", "zh": "哼哼哼～……\n啊，{$P$}，辛苦了～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0543_1002_p", "source_sha256": "a580ceafa157ddcb347114bcc7ebac1291c2edf22481f6454d8665fe3817ef71", "ja": "雪歩、お疲れさま。\nソロでの出演だったけど、絶好調だったな！", "zh": "雪步，辛苦了。\n虽然是单独出演，但状态真不错啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0543_1003_004yuk", "source_sha256": "f2d1fe26bf663d67722f6691e75c3ee32dfa40858f0ac17dc3fd12ed77e11f50", "ja": "そ、そうですか？　よかった……。\n最近は、お仕事が前より楽しくできてて。", "zh": "是、是吗？那太好了……\n最近工作起来比以前开心多了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0543_1004_004yuk", "source_sha256": "ad6c3453ab9167a9da071ed8af8d03a113c700aa1a50ee6d74cd6ef5d615d2a4", "ja": "今日もまだまだ、もっともっと、\nたくさん頑張れるかもです！", "zh": "今天也还能继续努力，或许可以比现在更加更加努力，做很多事情！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0543_1005_p", "source_sha256": "946130a2cb5fac17e106ee3f5f29d5f79901eb53f401af5746a884664dd2f214", "ja": "それは頼もしいな。\nもしかして、ライブの成功が自信につながったとか？", "zh": "那可真令人放心。难道说，演唱会的成功让你更有自信了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0543_1006_004yuk", "source_sha256": "25f40cf4c3a79d1b7831ef5a54a732c3dd1ed18294a02e53ac77145854965f12", "ja": "あ……。たぶん、それもあるんですけど。\nきっと、それだけじゃなくて……。", "zh": "啊……可能这也是原因之一。\n但肯定还不止这些……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0543_1007_004yuk", "source_sha256": "7f89fdae6794d76643658971c2fd5f58c2c7884ee56b249be6218e820256d1a7", "ja": "私、今回のツインライブで、初めて……\n真ちゃんの隣に、ちゃんと立てた気がしていて。", "zh": "我觉得，在这次的双人演唱会上，我第一次……\n真正感觉到自己能好好地站在真身旁了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0543_1008_p", "source_sha256": "d84c0350272f2e39a507d9228d929f3d69bd8a29e24795a7af25635d14b46b12", "ja": "ん？　初めて？", "zh": "嗯？第一次吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0543_1009_004yuk", "source_sha256": "638e3875ae9b64b46df5a1389f1859244b9e797447099d4554cf79d7c5004af3", "ja": "は、はい。私はアイドルになってからずっと、\n真ちゃんに頼ってばっかりでしたから。", "zh": "是、是的。因为我成为偶像之后，一直都只会依赖真。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0543_1010_004yuk", "source_sha256": "7c11ac26a54b5ba0de882f8ef191acad3247fb9847cc04b83e52dc8bd3b06620", "ja": "お仕事で急に恐くなった時も、\nステージで失敗した時も、真ちゃんはいつも……", "zh": "即使在工作中突然感到害怕，\n或是在舞台上失误时，真总是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0543_1011_004yuk", "source_sha256": "71b36c4231657ca796736b547481ae47b04b1834d6b49c6ce04349b1a4979444", "ja": "「大丈夫だよ」「絶対できる」\n「一緒に頑張ろう」って、励ましてくれて。", "zh": "“没关系的”、“一定可以做到的”、\n“一起加油吧”，这样鼓励着我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0543_1012_004yuk", "source_sha256": "2ad6addd2ace20ad8107f6ce40c75da7fee209008a2d8a9565cdecd21c0e3ccf", "ja": "でも、今回のツインライブでは、私、助けてもらう\nばっかりじゃなくて……。", "zh": "不过，这次的双人演唱会，我也不只是一直受你帮助……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0543_1013_004yuk", "source_sha256": "1e4f7ad5d766cad08eaa1f22941f3e548120465f1932a2f4b00ae2778efe07d4", "ja": "ちゃんと真ちゃんと一緒に、ライブを作れたかもって。", "zh": "我觉得，这次终于能和真一起，好好地完成了这场演唱会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0543_1014_p", "source_sha256": "358b63cb70a7a039512b9418325c147744ba55725f6ed7aec9c53a20646163ba", "ja": "……そうだな。真と雪歩の二人が、文字通り、\n力を合わせて作ってくれたライブだと思う。", "zh": "……是啊。我觉得这是小真和雪步两个人，真正齐心协力打造出的演唱会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0543_1015_004yuk", "source_sha256": "af5bdeadf8ffd6dcc1a2380a0d74caf6bae9e260f7342b4e234f971269610558", "ja": "そ、そうですよねっ。だから……これからは、\nますます頑張らなくちゃって、思ってるんです。", "zh": "是、是啊。所以……我觉得从今以后更要加倍努力才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_004yuk0543_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_004yuk0543_1016_004yuk", "source_sha256": "80ead432150ee4c3f07e4b05e19b9711a3c3ecb515bcd72c2f5180605c7ab657", "ja": "だって、真ちゃんの隣に立つ子が、ダメダメなままだと\n……私がイヤですから。えへへ♪", "zh": "因为，要是站在小真身边的那个女孩子一直这么没用……我会不高兴的。嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
